    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general municipal law, in relation to the repair reserve funds for municipal corporations, school districts, board of cooperative educational services, district corporations and improvement districts",
    "basePrintNo": "S5137",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S5137-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
